{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1021.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"6100c4f104bd53e86f2e9459b3f651e24ab7688ae8962b4678568661ac9b395c","ja":"ドキドキの発売日！","zh":"心跳加速的发售日！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1021.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"4c54a0e83d83ba5ca451f00312785377deae6e7b5d79d3bb3af91e5e0b306e50","ja":"『セカキュー2』の発売日当日……","zh":"『世界救2』发售日当天……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1021.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"edc69dc520242dccb4222dd02144e75739360e0ae620e7ed6e8990dc89f9c538","ja":"あ、美奈子さん！　おはようございます！","zh":"啊，美奈子！早上好！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1021.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"dd9ed3879e64eb82df13dd3bf092f13fd48a2b799b0d3cb59f64e9a399a40343","ja":"おはよう！　せっかくだから早く来て\nみたけど……開店2時間前はさすがに早すぎたかな？","zh":"早上好！难得来一次就想着早点过来，\n不过……离开店还有2小时，果然还是来得太早了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1021.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"1c546fd2ba1b899a6ce16461b8c5ec1d834be3961659c94b8392e1a7af9fbb06","ja":"そうですね……でも初回限定版をゲットする\nためですから！　念には念をいれないと！","zh":"也是呢……不过这都是为了能拿到\n初回限定版！必须慎之又慎才行！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1021.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"87831c4a1c315ac88a056722c8c02a8aaa911e6023278c4e12c090a4cb89ad82","ja":"ええと、たしかあっちの角を曲がったところに\n……あれ！？","zh":"那个，我记得应该是在转过那个拐角的地方\n……咦！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1021.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"d08a4996c611c45f402581778a3b1323d898ea381573254f90a7463c6fdea95d","ja":"わあっ、結構並んでるね～！　すごいな～！\nこれだけたくさんの人が待ってくれてるんだね♪","zh":"哇，排了好多人呢～！好厉害啊～！\n有这么多人在这里等着我们呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1021.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"cc29e7ceaf2659ada92e4b50ff6c5b675f4910fedec03562bf3c473d9d5cee6f","ja":"は、はい。それに……美奈子さん！\n列の先頭を見てください……！","zh":"好、好的。而且……美奈子！\n请看队伍的最前面……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1021.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"5231dfc0fa7fa3791abe62b5d588210a73a2e2125721d94439461c29ae2a6c88","ja":"えっ……あっ！　やよいちゃん！？\nいったい何時から並んで……！？","zh":"诶……啊！弥生！？\n你到底是从几点开始排队的……！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1021.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"355f5a5c92322d0fb506a987fe61c0b32d69b643987c433f9bfc3abad343aea0","ja":"数時間後……。","zh":"数小时后……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1021.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"72c2dedfa94d2def961c49c9f9846cf037805b7f6ad18994b525d3ad488023d7","ja":"みんな初回限定版が買えてよかったですねっ！\nオリジナルドラマCD、楽しみです～♪","zh":"大家都能买到初回限定版，真是太好了呢！\n好期待原创广播剧CD呀～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1021.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"6b318bd1c8950c0a27e7390f14595ed93fd2f5f84d21906d07dda4ae656ba1fb","ja":"はい！　でもまさか、やよいさんが\n列の一番目にいるなんて思いませんでした。","zh":"是的！不过真没想到，弥生小姐\n居然会排在队伍的最前头。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1021.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"59cdf530be6fff3667880a5914de6753720b3da811b6a93a8e610070b2a829ce","ja":"えへへ、今日が発売日だなーって思ったら、\nワクワクしてすっごく早い時間に起きちゃって！","zh":"嘿嘿，一想到今天是发售日，\n我就激动得特别早就醒了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1021.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"9f8bc7e963659d416274ea6ac85fe35edadc4fa470af2b54fbedb4a8b1676962","ja":"ふふ、さすがやよいちゃんだね……あれ？\nところで朋花ちゃんは？　さっき見かけなかったよね。","zh":"呵呵，真不愧是弥生呢……咦？\n话说朋花呢？刚才没看到她吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1021.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"8c33507ae2f5d4b619160450c58c1873225730baee0eb4c78ab3cb0173d3a106","ja":"そうですね……朋花さんも発売日には\nお店へ行くって言ってたんですけど……あ！","zh":"也是呢……朋花也说过发售日那天\n会去店里一趟……啊！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1021.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"3cea7d448f01a15bdbc765da0e592c61966c8addc0d8897cef0aebdd58287d19","ja":"朋花さんから連絡きました！\n別店舗の限定特典、ゲットしたそうですよっ！","zh":"朋花小姐发联络过来了！\n听说她拿到其他店铺的限定特典了哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
